<title>UK: Adscene names new finance director.</title>
<headline>Adscene names new finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Adscene Group Plc said on Monday that it has appointed Robert Broadley as finance director.</p>
<p>Broadley takes over from Nigel Chevin-Hall who stepped down from the local advertising newspaper publisher in November 1996.</p>
<p>He spent seven years as group financial controller at United News &amp; Media Plc and before that was Eurpean controller at Reuters Europe.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
